  ('Intake Roller Wheel (8mm REX®, 12mm Diameter, 16mm Width, 30A Durometer) - 8 Pack', '3618-4008-0012', 'This 12mm OD super grippy roller stretches over an 8mm REX® shaft. It is a key component when you are creating a compact intake. This 8 pack covers 128mm of continuous linear shaft.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/intake-roller-wheel-8mm-rex-12mm-diameter-16mm-width-30a-durometer-8-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1615/images/8444/3618-4008-0012__71888__84284.1701993468.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Intake Roller Wheel (8mm REX®, 16mm Diameter, 16mm Width, 30A Durometer) - 8 Pack', '3618-4008-0016', 'This 16mm OD super grippy roller stretches over an 8mm REX® shaft. It is a key component when you are creating a compact intake. This 8 pack covers 128mm of continuous linear shaft.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/intake-roller-wheel-8mm-rex-16mm-diameter-16mm-width-30a-durometer-8-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1616/images/8451/3618-4008-0016__59251__81295.1701993470.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('3619 Series Thin Rhino Wheel (14mm Bore, 96mm Diameter, 30A Durometer)', '3619-0014-0096', 'The 96mm wheel diameter matches many of our wheel options so you can mix-and-match at will. The slab-sided nature of the Thin Rhino Wheel can be mounted in either orientation - flip them out for a wide track-width or suck them in to minimize bump-steer on your Ackermann steering system. Bolt them together to build ''duals'' for greater traction and load-bearing capabilities. The 30A durometer rubber tread is a softer, higher traction option than our 70A durometer wheels (which are harder and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3619-series-thin-rhino-wheel-14mm-bore-96mm-diameter-30a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1725/images/9036/3619-0014-0096__36284__61501.1701993659.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Rhino Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Swivel Caster Wheel (M8 x 1.25mm Male Stud)', '3621-0001-0001', 'This polyurethane swivel caster wheel delivers smooth and easy maneuverability. Features include a 360 degree ball-bearing swivel and a zinc-plated carbon steel yoke. The M8 x 1.25mm stud is common within swivel casters and can be fastened to your build using the M8 x 1.25mm to goBILDA Pattern Mount.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/swivel-caster-wheel-m8-x-1-25mm-male-stud/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1652/images/8634/3621-0001-0001__98763__80387.1701993531.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Caster Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('72mm Omni Wheel (14mm Bore, 50A Durometer)', '3624-0014-0072', 'While most wheels only roll one(1) way well, omni wheels have special rollers that allow them to travel smoothly in perpendicular lateral directions (in addition to being able to be driven for good ol'' lengthwise-rolling motion). That''s why omni wheels are perfectly at home in holonomic drive systems where you want your project to be able to move in all directions! A combination of two sets of rollers is required to maintain constant roller contact with a travel surface. This 72mm Diameter Omni…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/72mm-omni-wheel-14mm-bore-50a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2518/images/16748/m%25252F547%25252FAng1__82272__67856.1782152926.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Omni Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('96mm Omni Wheel (14mm Bore, 50A Durometer)', '3624-0014-0096', 'While most wheels only roll one(2) way well, omni wheels have special rollers that allow them to travel smoothly in perpendicular lateral directions (in addition to being able to be driven for good ol'' lengthwise-rolling motion). That''s why omni wheels are perfectly at home in holonomic drive systems where you want your project to be able to move in all directions! A combination of two sets of rollers is required to maintain constant roller contact with a travel surface. This 96mm Diameter Omni…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/96mm-omni-wheel-14mm-bore-50a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2278/images/13565/Ang1__72399.1728660639.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Omni Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('3624 Series Omni Wheel (8mm REX® Bore, 32mm Diameter, 50A Durometer)', '3624-4008-0032', 'This 32mm Diameter Omni Wheel possesses two rows of 50A durometer rollers that have excellent traction on soft floor tiles, such as those used in the First Tech Challenge (FTC). The purpose-engineered grip is one(3) great feature among other nifty proficiencies: The wheel core''s 8mm REX® bore provides positive drive on 8mm REX® shafting. The narrow wheel width allows for easy implementation, even when space is at a premium. This particular Omni Wheel is the same one(4) used in the goBILDA® 4-Bar…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3624-series-omni-wheel-8mm-rex-bore-32mm-diameter-50a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2231/images/13236/Main__36915__54616.1725047395.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Omni Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('48mm Omni Wheel (8mm REX® Bore, 50A Durometer)', '3624-4008-0048', 'This 48mm Diameter Omni Wheel is designed for use in the goBILDA® Odometry Pod (SKU: 3110-0001-0001). The two rows of 50A durometer rollers have excellent traction on soft floor tiles, such as those used in the First Tech Challenge (FTC). Looking to implement this wheel outside the Odometry Pod? You''ll appreciate these additional proficiencies: The wheel core''s 8mm REX® bore provides positive drive on 8mm REX™ shafting. The goBILDA® 16mm-pattern holes allow for the use of a hub for using the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/48mm-omni-wheel-8mm-rex-bore-50a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2006/images/10993/Ang1__98321__34763.1701994277.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Omni Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('GripForce™ Mecanum Wheel Set (Ø104mm, 40A Durometer Rollers)', '3625-0202-0104', 'GripForce™ Mecanum Wheels enhance your robot''s omnidirectional traction! Whether moving forward, backward, laterally, or diagonally on the foam mats of FTC game fields, your bot''s acceleration and deceleration benefit from these mecanum wheel''s innovative GripForce™ tread pattern that delivers exceptional grip as the soft tiles conform around it. The following features contribute to the GripForce™ Mecanum Wheels'' superior performance in FTC: 40A Durometer Silicone Rubber Rollers: The 40A…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gripforce-mecanum-wheel-set-o104mm-40a-durometer-rollers/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2233/images/13277/Main__71373__72621.1750685717.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Mecanum Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hogback Traction Wheel (72mm Diameter, 50A Durometer)', '3626-0014-0072', 'Rocking a geological name inspired by the travel-optimizing centerline topology underneath its grippy rubber, the Hogback Traction Wheel is a premier wheel-hub solution that''s purpose-designed to be the Goldilocks wheel for competitive robotics! This particular 72mm diameter variant is the little sibling of the 96mm Hogback Traction Wheel. A Wheel That''s Just Right! Yes, "Goldilocks wheel" is a high bar! The Hogback Wheel reaches the peak of performance by combining durable plastic with…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hogback-traction-wheel-72mm-diameter-50a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2470/images/16550/3626-0014-0072_-_CAT__19787.1776459685.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Hogback Traction Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hogback Traction Wheel (96mm Diameter, 50A Durometer)', '3626-0014-0096', 'Rocking a geological name inspired by the travel-optimizing centerline topology underneath its grippy rubber, the Hogback Traction Wheel is a premier wheel-hub solution that''s purpose-designed to be the Goldilocks wheel for competitive robotics! A Wheel That''s Just Right! Yes, "Goldilocks wheel" is a high bar! The Hogback Wheel reaches the peak of performance by combining durable plastic with securely bonded rubber. The Hogback''s rubber rests atop an elevated plastic ridge (also known as a…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hogback-traction-wheel-96mm-diameter-50a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2392/images/16644/3626-0014-0096-Ang1__29335.1776779177.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Hogback Traction Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('U-Wheel (8mm Groove, 4mm ID Bearings, 32mm Diameter) - 2 Pack', '3627-0004-3212', 'Designed to support linear motion with Rail-Channel, this polycarbonate U-Wheel features two pressed-in 4mm ID bearings for smooth rotation on M4 screws as well as 4mm diameter shafting. While one(5) bearing is flush with a side of the wheel, the side with the opposite bearing offers a space for easy carriage-height adjustment and clearance for hardware. You can run U-Wheels on lengths of Rail-Channel by placing two parallel lines of multiple U-Wheels 96mm apart from each other.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/u-wheel-8mm-groove-4mm-id-bearings-32mm-diameter-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2333/images/14234/3627-0004-3212__40356__25365.1732228197.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / Rail-Channel and U-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('U-Wheel (8mm Groove, 6mm ID Bearings, 32mm Diameter) - 2 Pack', '3627-0006-3212', 'Designed to support linear motion with Rail-Channel, this polycarbonate ID U-Wheel features two pressed-in6mm bearings for smooth rotation on 6mm diameter components---such as round or D-profile shafting, or standoffs. While one(6) bearing is flush with a side of the wheel, the side with the opposite bearing offers a space for easy carriage-height adjustment and clearance for hardware. You can run U-Wheels on lengths of Rail-Channel by placing two parallel lines of multiple U-Wheels 96mm apart…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/u-wheel-8mm-groove-6mm-id-bearings-32mm-diameter-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2332/images/14229/3627-0006-3212__85289__34796.1732228183.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / Rail-Channel and U-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('U-Wheel (8mm Groove, 8mm ID Bearings, 32mm Diameter) - 2 Pack', '3627-0008-3212', 'Designed to support linear motion with Rail-Channel, this polycarbonate U-Wheel features two pressed-in 8mm ID bearings for smooth rotation on 8mm diameter components---such as shafting or standoffs. While one(7) bearing is flush with a side of the wheel, the side with the opposite bearing offers a space for easy carriage-height adjustment and clearance for hardware. You can run U-Wheels on lengths of Rail-Channel by placing two parallel lines of multiple U-Wheels 96mm apart from each other.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/u-wheel-8mm-groove-8mm-id-bearings-32mm-diameter-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2331/images/14224/3627-0008-3212_1__42934__61734.1732228169.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / Rail-Channel and U-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('U-Wheel (8mm Groove, 8mm REX® ID Bearings, 32mm Diameter) - 2 Pack', '3627-4008-3212', 'Designed to support linear motion with Rail-Channel, this polycarbonate U-Wheel features two pressed-in 8mm REX® bearings for smooth rotation on 8mm REX® profile components---such as shafting or standoffs. While one(8) bearing is flush with a side of the wheel, the side with the opposite bearing offers a space for easy carriage-height adjustment and clearance for hardware. You can run U-Wheels on lengths of Rail-Channel by placing two parallel lines of multiple U-Wheels 96mm apart from each other.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/u-wheel-8mm-groove-8mm-rex-id-bearings-32mm-diameter-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2330/images/14219/3627-4008-3212__84544__27066.1732228156.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Channel / Rail-Channel and U-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Flywheel (60mm Diameter, 115g, 551 g·cm²)', '3628-0014-0060', 'Built for compact attachment to the 72mm Diameter version of our Hogback Traction Wheel, this 60mm Diameter Flywheel is a sleek and space-efficient way to bump up the rotational inertia of your wheel system! Rotational inertia is key to a wheel-based launcher system, and having control over the amount of rotational inertia in your system puts the controls for optimizing your system squarely in your hands. When a high-speed wheel contacts an object you''d like to throw, the wheel (when it has…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-flywheel-60mm-diameter-115g-551-g-cm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2478/images/16514/Ang1__12892.1776458969.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Flywheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Flywheel (82mm Diameter, 152g, 1651 g·cm²)', '3628-0032-0082', 'Built for our 96mm Diameter Hogback Traction Wheel, this Flywheel is a sleek and space-efficient way to bump up the rotational inertia of your wheel system! Rotational inertia is key to a wheel-based launcher system, and having control over the amount of rotational inertia in your system puts the controls for optimizing your system squarely in your hands. When a high-speed wheel contacts an object you''d like to throw, the wheel (when it has enough grip!) transfers energy into the object to…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-flywheel-82mm-diameter-152g-1651-g-cm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2424/images/15239/Ang1__98257__00148__22658__78178.1761676109.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Flywheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('GripForce Gecko™ Wheel (14mm Bore, 72mm Diameter, 15A Durometer)', '3632-0014-0072', 'Grab the utmost of grippage with this 72mm Diameter Gripforce Gecko Wheel™! Constructed of high-grip silicone rubber, and featuring raised pips that echo the toe pads of a gecko, this wheel has excellent traction against a multitude of surfaces. At an ultra-soft 15A durometer, this wheel''s highly-compliant grey silicone readily conforms to the unique contours of game elements, maximizing surface area contact to deliver an exceptionally reliable, grabby grip for fast-moving intakes and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gripforce-gecko-wheel-14mm-bore-72mm-diameter-15a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2557/images/17035/3632-0014-0072-CAT__22494.1788882983.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('GripForce Gecko™ Wheel (14mm Bore, 96mm Diameter, 15A Durometer)', '3632-0014-0096', 'Grab the utmost of grippage with this 96mm Diameter Gripforce Gecko Wheel™! Constructed of high-grip silicone rubber, and featuring raised pips that echo the toe pads of a gecko, this wheel has excellent traction against a multitude of surfaces. At an ultra-soft 15A durometer, this wheel''s highly-compliant grey silicone readily conforms to the unique contours of game elements, maximizing surface area contact to deliver an exceptionally reliable, grabby grip for fast-moving intakes and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gripforce-gecko-wheel-14mm-bore-96mm-diameter-15a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2558/images/17041/3632-0014-0096-CAT__82147.1788905405.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('GripForce Gecko™ Wheel (8mm REX® Bore, 32mm Diameter, 15A Durometer)', '3632-4008-0032', 'Grab the utmost of grippage with this 32mm Diameter Gripforce Gecko Wheel™! Constructed of high-grip silicone rubber, and featuring raised pips that echo the toe pads of a gecko, this wheel has excellent traction against a multitude of surfaces. At an ultra-soft 15A durometer, this wheel''s highly-compliant grey silicone readily conforms to the unique contours of game elements, maximizing surface area contact to deliver an exceptionally reliable, grabby grip for fast-moving intakes and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gripforce-gecko-wheel-8mm-rex-bore-32mm-diameter-15a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2555/images/17014/Scaled_Thumb__39344.1787950588.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('GripForce Gecko™ Wheel (8mm REX® Bore, 48mm Diameter, 15A Durometer)', '3632-4008-0048', 'Grab the utmost of grippage with this 48mm Diameter Gripforce Gecko Wheel™! Constructed of high-grip silicone rubber, and featuring raised pips that echo the toe pads of a gecko, this wheel has excellent traction against a multitude of surfaces. At an ultra-soft 15A durometer, this wheel''s highly-compliant grey silicone readily conforms to the unique contours of game elements, maximizing surface area contact to deliver an exceptionally reliable, grabby grip for fast-moving intakes and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gripforce-gecko-wheel-8mm-rex-bore-48mm-diameter-15a-durometer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2556/images/17022/Scaled_Thumb__23283.1787950987.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('3700 Series 14.5mm V-Guide (288mm Length)', '3700-0145-0288', 'V-Guides are designed to work with both V-Groove Bearings and W-Wheels. They have M4 sized grooves running the entire length allowing your M4 screws to be threaded in at any point along the guide.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3700-series-14-5mm-v-guide-288mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/590/images/3634/3700-0145-0288-3000px__12186__56805.1701991959.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
  ('3700 Series 14.5mm V-Guide (624mm Length)', '3700-0145-0624', 'V-Guides are designed to work with both V-Groove Bearings and W-Wheels. They have M4 sized grooves running the entire length allowing your M4 screws to be threaded in at any point along the guide.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3700-series-14-5mm-v-guide-624mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/592/images/3651/3700-0145-0624-3000px__42254__36066.1701991963.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
  ('3700 Series 14.5mm V-Guide (1200mm Length)', '3700-0145-1200', 'V-Guides are designed to work with both V-Groove Bearings and W-Wheels. They have M4 sized grooves running the entire length allowing your M4 screws to be threaded in at any point along the guide.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3700-series-14-5mm-v-guide-1200mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/596/images/3663/3700-0145-1200-3000px__41251__62951.1701991967.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
  ('3704 Series Plastic goRAIL® Slide Plate (43-1) - 2 Pack', '3704-0043-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3704-series-plastic-gorail-slide-plate-43-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1040/images/5080/3704-0043-0001-Ang-2__25701__28199.1701992423.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('goRAIL® Slide-Block (43-2) - 2 Pack', '3704-0043-0002', 'Just as a skilled billiards player makes their hand into a closed bridge to guide their cue, this goRAIL® Slide-Block provides the perfect combination of smooth support and guidance for goRAIL® to move linearly inside 1120 Series U-Channel! The 43mm width allows this Slide-Block to nestle perfectly inside 1120 Series U-Channel. The overmolded threaded inserts provide a quick and solid means of attachment via included M4 socket head screws. Keep in mind the spacing of the two included…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gorail-slide-block-43-2-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2430/images/15283/Ang2__31924__32923.1759418780.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Lead (FH-MC, 300mm Length)', '3800-0001-0300', 'This XT30 lead consists of 300mm length, 16AWG, bonded wire that is terminated in an XT30 (FH-MC) connector on one(9) end and bare wires on the other. The bare wires are great for going into screw terminals of a motor controller, soldering into thru-holes of a PCB or for soldering up a custom wiring harness. The connector on this lead is the mate to the connector found on many of our batteries. Tech Tip FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-lead-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1193/images/5973/3800-0001-0300__33283__38785.1701992708.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Lead (MH-FC, 300mm Length)', '3800-0002-0300', 'This XT30 lead consists of 300mm length, 16AWG, bonded wire that is terminated in an XT30 (MH-FC) connector on one(10) end and bare wires on the other. This XT30 connector is the same as found on many of our batteries, and is commonly used on the source of power. If you are converting from an old-school connector, such as Deans, Tamiya or Anderson and feel more comfortable soldering wires together than soldering the connector on the end of the wires, this lead gives you the ability to make that…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-lead-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1447/images/7206/3800-0002-0300__22552__74929.1701993094.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('Tamiya Lead (MH-FC, 100mm Length)', '3800-0003-0100', 'This Tamiya lead consists of 100mm length, 14AWG, high strand wire that is terminated in a Tamiya connector (MH-FC) on one(11) end and bare wires on the other. The bare wires are great for going into screw terminals of a motor controller, soldering into thru-holes of a PCB or for soldering up a custom wiring harness. The Tamiya connector on the opposing end is compatible with the First Tech Challenge approved 12V Battery.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/tamiya-lead-mh-fc-100mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1200/images/5996/3800-0003-0100__07737__63128.1701992715.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: Tamiya', 'gobilda'),
  ('3.5mm Bullet Lead (FH-MC, 300mm Length)', '3800-0012-0300', 'This bullet lead consists of 300mm length, 16AWG, bonded wire that is terminated in 3.5mm (FH-MC) bullet connectors on one(12) end and bare wires on the other. This is the same connector style as found on the end of the wires on our Yellow Jacket Gear Motors. If you have a project that you want to wire up custom motors, or just have a project that requires a high quality connection in a compact form-factor, this lead may fit the bill.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-5mm-bullet-lead-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1218/images/6069/3800-0012-0300_8mmTips__63851__60104.1701992737.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: 3.5mm Bullet', 'gobilda'),
  ('3.5mm Bullet Lead (MH-FC, 300mm Length)', '3800-0013-0300', 'This bullet lead consists of 300mm length, 16AWG, bonded wire that is terminated in 3.5mm (MH-FC) bullet connectors on one(13) end and bare wires on the other. The bare wires are great for going into screw terminals of a motor controller, soldering into thru-holes of a PCB or for soldering up a custom wiring harness. The connectors on this lead are directly compatible with our Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motors. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-5mm-bullet-lead-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1199/images/5991/3800-0013-0300_8mmTips__70218__40049.1701992713.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: 3.5mm Bullet', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Lead (MH-FC, 100mm Length) - 2 Pack', '3800-0017-0100', 'This 100mm length servo lead has a TJC8 Servo Connector on one(14) end and bare wires on the other so that it can be inserted into screw terminals or soldered into another set of wires. The TJC8 Servo Connector is MH-FC which means the housing is male and the contacts within are female. This end is commonly found on servos and AA cell battery packs and is compatible with the FH-MC connector as well as row pins with a 2.54mm (0.100") spacing. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-lead-mh-fc-100mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/849/images/4660/3800-0017-0100__54644__00665.1701992262.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Lead (MH-FC, 150mm Length) - 2 Pack', '3800-0017-0150', 'This 150mm length servo lead has a TJC8 Servo Connector on one(15) end and bare wires on the other so that it can be inserted into screw terminals or soldered into another set of wires. The TJC8 Servo Connector is MH-FC which means the housing is male and the contacts within are female. This end is commonly found on servos and AA cell battery packs and is compatible with the FH-MC connector as well as row pins with a 2.54mm (0.100") spacing. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-lead-mh-fc-150mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/850/images/4668/3800-0017-0150__63114__02265.1701992264.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Lead (MH-FC, 300mm Length) - 2 Pack', '3800-0017-0300', 'This 300mm length servo lead has a TJC8 Servo Connector on one(16) end and bare wires on the other so that it can be inserted into screw terminals or soldered into another set of wires. The TJC8 Servo Connector is MH-FC which means the housing is male and the contacts within are female. This end is commonly found on servos and AA cell battery packs and is compatible with the FH-MC connector as well as row pins with a 2.54mm (0.100") spacing. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-lead-mh-fc-300mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/877/images/4754/3800-0017-0300__18328__26486.1701992290.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Lead (FH-MC, 150mm Length) - 2 Pack', '3800-0018-0150', 'This 150mm length servo lead has a TJC8 Servo Connector on one(17) end and bare wires on the other end so it can be inserted into screw terminals or soldered onto another set of wires. The TJC8 Servo Connector is FH-MC which means the housing is female and the contacts within are male. This end is the mate to the connector found on many servos and AA cell battery packs. Tech Tip FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-lead-fh-mc-150mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/845/images/4653/3800-0018-0150__28204__67539.1701992258.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Lead (FH-MC, 300mm Length) - 2 Pack', '3800-0018-0300', 'This 300mm length servo lead has a TJC8 Servo Connector on one(18) end and bare wires on the other end so that it can be inserted into screw terminals or soldered onto another set of wires. The TJC8 Servo Connector is FH-MC which means the housing is female and the contacts within are male. This end is the mate to the connector found on many servos and AA cell battery packs. Tech Tip FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-lead-fh-mc-300mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/847/images/4655/3800-0018-0300__93155__89780.1701992260.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 [FH-MC] to 3.5mm Bullet [MH-FC] Adaptor (300mm Length)', '3801-0113-0300', 'This adaptor is useful when you want to connect your motor directly to a battery or power supply if you have a setup where only simple non-speed-controlled continuous rotation is needed. It can also be very useful for a quick test to confirm the mechanical setup is good or to eliminate other electronic variables when troubleshooting.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-fh-mc-to-3-5mm-bullet-mh-fc-adaptor-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1577/images/8270/3801-0113-0300__67335__97458.1701993410.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 [FH-MC] to XT60 [MH-FC] Adaptor (150mm Length)', '3801-0115-0150', 'This 150mm adaptor cable cleanly bridges the gap between XT30 and XT60 power ecosystems. The XT30 end features male contacts [FH-MC], making it a perfect fit for plugging directly into a battery or power supply, while the XT60 end features female contacts [MH-FC] to connect smoothly into motor controllers (ESCs) or other power-receiving devices. While current can safely flow in either direction depending on your custom wiring layout, this configuration aligns perfectly with the standard…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-fh-mc-to-xt60-mh-fc-adaptor-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2521/images/16768/d%25252F876%25252FAng1__59044__77446.1782245048.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT60', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 [FH-MC] to 2-Pos TJC8 Power Connector [MH-FC] Adaptor (60mm Length)', '3801-0121-0060', 'This adaptor allows you to connect a battery which has an XT30 connector, to 2.54mm (0.1") pitch row pins. Tech Tip FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contact MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contact', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-fh-mc-to-2-pos-tjc8-power-connector-mh-fc-adaptor-60mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1322/images/16709/3801-0121-0060__04903.1779135378.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 [MH-FC] to Tamiya [MH-FC] Adaptor (60mm Length)', '3801-0203-0060', 'If you have a battery or component with a Tamiya and need to convert to an XT30 to be compatible with your motor controller and/or charger, this adaptor does the trick.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-mh-fc-to-tamiya-mh-fc-adaptor-60mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/830/images/4587/3801-0203-0060__57330__86170.1701992240.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: Tamiya', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 [MH-FC] to 2-Pos TJC8 Power Connector [FH-MC] Adaptor (60mm Length)', '3801-0222-0060', 'This adaptor allows you to charge a battery that has a TJC8 (MH-FC) connector, using a charger that contains an XT30 (FH-MC) connector. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contact FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contact', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-mh-fc-to-2-pos-tjc8-power-connector-fh-mc-adaptor-60mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1263/images/6257/3801-0222-0060__90176__41337.1701992798.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('4-Pos JST PH to 3-Pos JST PH Adaptor (300mm Length)', '3801-0454-0300', 'This handy adaptor wire can connect a 3-Pos JST PH connector to a 4-Pos JST PH connector. (As such, it leaves one(19) of the contacts unpopulated.) Are you participating in the FIRST® Tech Challenge (FTC)? This wire is a perfect solution for connecting a digital or analog sensor to a digital or analog port on a REV Robotics Control Hub or a REV Robotics Expansion Hub.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-pos-jst-ph-to-3-pos-jst-ph-adaptor-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2447/images/15394/3801-0454-0300-REV0__56714__72564.1760476255.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST PH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('Anderson Powerpole to Female XT30 Adaptor', '3801-0502-0060', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/anderson-powerpole-to-female-xt30-adaptor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2427/images/15250/anderson-power-pole-to-female-xt30-adaptor-3000px_2__05079.1568244312.1280.1280__11334__23454.1758806290.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: Anderson Powerpole', 'gobilda'),
  ('Anderson Powerpole to 3.5mm Bullet [MH-FC] Adaptor (100mm Length)', '3801-0513-0100', 'This Anderson Powerpole to 3.5mm Bullet Adaptor is a plug-and-play solution to convert your Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor from the 3.5mm bullet connectors to Anderson Powerpoles.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/anderson-powerpole-to-3-5mm-bullet-mh-fc-adaptor-100mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1024/images/4997/3801-0513-0100__59296__71821.1701992392.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: Anderson Powerpole', 'gobilda'),
  ('2-Pos JST VH [MH-FC] to 3.5mm Bullet [MH-FC] Adaptor (100mm Length)', '3801-0613-0100', 'This adaptor allows you to convert your 5000 Series Motor or Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor from 3.5mm bullet connectors to the 2-Pos JST VH connector found on the REV Robotics Expansion Hub.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2-pos-jst-vh-mh-fc-to-3-5mm-bullet-mh-fc-adaptor-100mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/823/images/4564/3801-0613-0100__22657__34074.1701992234.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST VH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('4-Pos JST PH [MH-FC] to 4-Pos JST XH [MH-FC] Adaptor (150mm Length)', '3801-0709-0150', 'This 150mm Length JST adaptor is able to plug into the encoder found on 5000 Series Motors and 52xx Series Gear Motors, using the JST XH Series end. The remaining end is able to plug directly into the REV Robotics Expansion Hub; a controller commonly used in the FIRST Robotics FTC Challenge.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-pos-jst-ph-mh-fc-to-4-pos-jst-xh-mh-fc-adaptor-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1321/images/6508/3801-0709-0150__50306__03678.1701992873.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST XH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('4-Pos JST PH [MH-FC] to 4-Pos JST XH [MH-FC] Adaptor (300mm Length)', '3801-0709-0300', 'This 300mm Length JST adaptor is able to plug into the encoder found on 5000 Series Motors and 52xx Series Gear Motors, using the JST XH Series end. The remaining end is able to plug directly into the REV Robotics Expansion Hub; a controller commonly used in the FIRST Robotics FTC Challenge.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-pos-jst-ph-mh-fc-to-4-pos-jst-xh-mh-fc-adaptor-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/825/images/4571/3801-0709-0300__07240__59254.1701992236.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST XH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('4-Pos JST PH [MH-FC] to 4-Pos JST XH [MH-FC] Adaptor (600mm Length)', '3801-0709-0600', 'This 600mm Length JST adaptor is able to plug into the encoder found on 5000 Series Motors and 52xx Series Gear Motors, using the JST XH Series end. The remaining end is able to plug directly into the REV Robotics Expansion Hub; a controller commonly used in the FIRST Robotics FTC Challenge.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-pos-jst-ph-mh-fc-to-4-pos-jst-xh-mh-fc-adaptor-600mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1319/images/6499/3801-0709-0600__74647__22040.1701992869.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST XH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('Encoder Breakout Cable (4-Pos JST XH [MH-FC] to 4 x 1-Pos TJC8 [MH-FC], 300mm Length)', '3801-0919-0300', 'This cable is ideal for connecting your encoder to a Roboclaw motor controller as well as male pins on Arduinos and Raspberry Pis. It has an XH Series JST (MH-FC) connector on one(20) end, which is compatible with the encoders on our Yellow Jacket Gear Motors. The opposing end is split out into single female jumper wires (aka TJC8 [MH-FC]) which are compatible with 2.54mm (0.100") pitch header row pins. Having the jumper wire ends independent from one(21) another allows you to plug each wire into the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/encoder-breakout-cable-4-pos-jst-xh-mh-fc-to-4-x-1-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1211/images/6048/3801-0919-0300__22115__11537.1701992731.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Encoder Breakout Cable (4-Pos JST XH [MH-FC] to 4 x 1-Pos TJC8 [FH-MC], 300mm Length)', '3801-0920-0300', 'Plug this cable directly into the encoder found on 5000 Series Motors and 52xx Series Gear Motors to connect it to your project. The cable terminates in standard male jumper wires, making it compatible with many standard boards such as Raspberry Pis, solderless breadboards, motor controllers and more.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/encoder-breakout-cable-4-pos-jst-xh-mh-fc-to-4-x-1-pos-tjc8-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1239/images/6175/wire__53581__09292.1701992772.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 [MH-FC] to 3-Pos JST PH [MH-FC] Adaptor (300mm Length)', '3801-1754-0300', 'This 300mm length adaptor brings versatility to your wiring toolbox by allowing you to transfer signal and power between a TJC8 connector and a JST PH connector. It''s great to have on-hand when implementing goBILDA® PWM-controlled lights into your wiring system! Both JST PH and TJC8 are common connector styles. The three-position configuration shared by the two styles in this adaptor allows it to perform as a single-wire solution for the transfer of a signal, as well as power and ground. Pay…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-3-pos-jst-ph-mh-fc-adaptor-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2298/images/13678/Ang1__40819__29317.1730384547.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT90 [FH-MC] to XT30 [MH-FC] Adaptor (300mm Length)', '3801-4002-0300', 'This 300mm length wire harness conveys power from an XT90 input to two XT30 outputs.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt90-fh-mc-to-xt30-mh-fc-adaptor-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1911/images/10345/3801-4002-0300__29548__01177.1701994075.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT90', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Extension (FH-MC to MH-FC, 150mm Length)', '3802-0102-0150', 'XT30 connectors are commonly found in high-current and polarity-specific components, such as a battery. This 150mm length XT30 extension is a plug-n-play solution for adding distance to your wires when you want to mount your battery away from your motor controller.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-extension-fh-mc-to-mh-fc-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1835/images/9897/3802-0102-0150__22788__61483.1701993935.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Extension (FH-MC to MH-FC, 300mm Length)', '3802-0102-0300', 'XT30 connectors are commonly found in high current applications that are polarity specific, such as a battery. This extension is a plug and play solution that will add distance to your wires in cases where you want to mount your battery away from your motor controller.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-extension-fh-mc-to-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/827/images/4573/3802-0102-0300__64685__68357.1701992237.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Extension (FH-MC to MH-FC, 600mm Length)', '3802-0102-0600', 'XT30 connectors are commonly found in high-current and polarity-specific components, such as a battery. This 600mm length XT30 extension is a plug-n-play solution for adding distance to your wires when you want to mount your battery away from your motor controller.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-extension-fh-mc-to-mh-fc-600mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1837/images/9905/3802-0102-0600__06726__55284.1701993937.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('Encoder Cable Extension (4-Pos JST XH, 300mm Length)', '3802-0910-0300', 'This encoder cable extension expands your robot''s wire routing options. Use it when your 4 pin JST XH Series encoder cable just won''t reach where you need it to go. It can plug into the back of any Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor, as well as into another 4 pin JST XH Series encoder cable. Daisy-chain multiple extensions together to achieve even greater lengths!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/encoder-cable-extension-4-pos-jst-xh-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1841/images/9921/3802-0910-0300_Angle1__72438__03699.1701993944.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST XH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('3.5mm Bullet Extension (MH-FC to FH-MC, 300mm Length)', '3802-1213-0300', 'Extensions are a plug and play solution to adding length to a wire that already has a connector installed. This bullet extension is commonly used with the Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motors so you can increase the distance between your controller and motor without having to solder or crimp wires in the process.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-5mm-bullet-extension-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/829/images/4582/3802-1213-0300__09305__39262.1701992239.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: 3.5mm Bullet', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 150mm Length)', '3802-1718-0150', 'This 150mm length servo extension will allow you to extend the distance between your servo and servo controller. In servo applications, the yellow wire carries the signal, red is positive and black is negative. These extensions can be useful in many applications outside of wiring servos, such as connecting a potentiometer or limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/879/images/4759/3802-1718-0150__13598__10369.1701992292.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 300mm Length)', '3802-1718-0300', 'This 300mm length servo extension will allow you to extend the distance between your servo and servo controller. In servo applications, the yellow wire carries the signal, red is positive and black is negative. These extensions can be useful in many applications outside of wiring servos, such as connecting a potentiometer or limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/881/images/4765/3802-1718-0300__58644__25036.1701992293.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 450mm Length)', '3802-1718-0450', 'This 450mm length servo extension will allow you to extend the distance between your servo and servo controller. In servo applications, the yellow wire carries the signal, red is positive and black is negative. These extensions can be useful in many applications outside of wiring servos, such as connecting a potentiometer or limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-450mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/882/images/4769/3802-1718-0450__02174__28783.1701992295.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 600mm Length)', '3802-1718-0600', 'This 600mm length servo extension will allow you to extend the distance between your servo and servo controller. In servo applications, the yellow wire carries the signal, red is positive and black is negative. These extensions can be useful in many applications outside of wiring servos, such as connecting a potentiometer or limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-600mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/884/images/4771/3802-1718-0600__51190__71909.1701992296.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 900mm Length)', '3802-1718-0900', 'This 900mm length servo extension will allow you to extend the distance between your servo and servo controller. In servo applications, the yellow wire carries the signal, red is positive and black is negative. These extensions can be useful in many applications outside of wiring servos, such as connecting a potentiometer or limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-900mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/886/images/4773/3802-1718-0900__62204__30217.1701992297.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 1200mm Length)', '3802-1718-1200', 'This 1200mm length servo extension will allow you to extend the distance between your servo and servo controller. In servo applications, the yellow wire carries the signal, red is positive and black is negative. These extensions can be useful in many applications outside of wiring servos, such as connecting a potentiometer or limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-1200mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/888/images/4775/3802-1718-1200__14002__71661.1701992298.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Male to Female Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 10cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3802-1920-0010', 'This 40 pack of 10cm length jumpers is great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each jumper is terminated on one(22) end with a TJC8 (MH-FC) which is able to connect with 2.54cm (0.1") spacing row pins or a TJC8 connector of the opposite gender. The opposing end is terminated with a TJC8 (FH-MC) which is able to plug into a breadboard or TJC8 connector of the opposing gender.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/male-to-female-jumper-wire-multicolor-10cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1189/images/5950/3802-1920-0010__75177__65362.1701992700.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Male to Female Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 20cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3802-1920-0020', 'This 40 pack of 20cm length jumpers is great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each jumper is terminated on one(23) end with a TJC8 (MH-FC) which is able to connect with 2.54cm (0.1") spacing row pins or a TJC8 connector of the opposite gender. The opposing end is terminated with a TJC8 (FH-MC) which is able to plug into a breadboard or TJC8 connector of the opposing gender.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/male-to-female-jumper-wire-multicolor-20cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1197/images/5986/3802-1920-0020__61033__81347.1701992712.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Male to Female Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 50cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3802-1920-0050', 'This 40 pack of 50cm length jumpers are great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each jumper is terminated on one(24) end with a TJC8 (MH-FC) which is able to connect with 2.54cm (0.1") spacing row pins or a TJC8 connector of the opposite gender. The opposing end is terminated with a TJC8 (FH-MC) which is able to plug into a breadboard or TJC8 connector of the opposing gender.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/male-to-female-jumper-wire-multicolor-50cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1194/images/5979/3802-1920-0050__04865__02221.1701992710.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('4 Channel Servo Extension via CAT6', '3802-2745-4527', 'This 4 Channel CAT6 Servo Extension lets you control up to four servos over a CAT6 cable. It boosts servo signals to allow for long-distance installations with jitter-free servo-motion and the rock-solid connectivity of a wired setup. It can control up to four servos at once, making it useful if you need to tidy up the wiring on your project. This product includes 1 Sending Board, 1 Receiving Board, and 4 servo extensions. Compatibility Ethernet Cables: While CAT6 is the recommended cable, the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-channel-servo-extension-via-cat6/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1864/images/10039/3802-2745-4527-REV1-Ang5__16963__59191.1701993977.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT90 Extension (FH-MC to MH-FC, 300mm Length)', '3802-4041-0300', 'This 300mm length XT90 extension is a plug-n-play solution for connecting components with XT90 connectors—such as a battery dock to a motor controller. It can also add length to existing XT90 wires.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt90-extension-fh-mc-to-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1912/images/10361/3802-4041-0300__14725__41685.1701994082.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT90', 'gobilda'),
  ('Right Angle PCB Mount XT30 Connector (MH-FC) - 2 Pack', '3803-0033-0002', 'This right angle XT30 connector (aka XT30PW-F) is intended to solder into thru-holes of a PCB. This will allow a battery or XT30 (FH-MC) connector to plug in and remain parallel to the circuit board to maintain a low profile. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contacts', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/right-angle-pcb-mount-xt30-connector-mh-fc-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1348/images/6605/3803-0033-0002__25680__89755.1701992904.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Connector Pack (FH-MC x 5, MH-FC x 5)', '3803-0102-0505', 'XT30 connectors are able to handle 30A continuous and 65A peak. The connectors have solder cups to install up to 16AWG wire into. They are polarity specific, meaning you can''t accidentally plug your battery or component in backwards. Their small form-factor allows the connectors to easily pass through the 14mm holes in goBILDA channel and components. You''ll find these same connectors on goBILDA batteries and chargers. Tech Tip FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contacts MH-FC = Male Housing, Female…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-connector-pack-fh-mc-x-5-mh-fc-x-5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/832/images/4591/3803-0102-0005__44466__62393.1701992242.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('3.5mm Bullet Connector Pack (MH-FC x 5, FH-MC x 5)', '3803-1213-0005', 'This connector pack comes with five 3.5mm (MH-FC) bullet connectors and five 3.5mm (FH-MC) connectors. These are the same connectors as found on the Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motors. They provide a reliable connection in a compact form-factor for wires up to 16AWG. This style of connector is great for applications, such as a motor, where you may want to reverse polarity by changing where the wires plug in. Tech Tip MH-FC = Male Housing, Female Contact FH-MC = Female Housing, Male Contact', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-5mm-bullet-connector-pack-mh-fc-x-5-fh-mc-x-5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/831/images/4588/3803-1213-0005_Ang2__18773__04815.1701992241.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: 3.5mm Bullet', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT60 Connector Pack (MH-FC x 5, FH-MC x 5)', '3803-1516-0505', 'XT60 connectors are able to handle 60A continuous and 180A peak when using 12AWG wire (150A peak for 14AWG wire). The connectors have solder cups to make installing the wire more simple and clean. They are polarity specific, meaning that you can''t accidentally plug your battery or component in backwards. They are too large to fit through a 14mm hole found in goBILDA channel (17mm hole size minimum required for pass-thru), but are necessary to use for high current applications. Tech Tip FH-MC =…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt60-connector-pack-mh-fc-x-5-fh-mc-x-5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1271/images/6300/3803-1516-0505__02291__06792.1701992810.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT60', 'gobilda'),
  ('JST PH Cable (4-Pos JST PH, MH-FC to MH-FC, 600mm Length)', '3804-0707-0600', 'This 600mm length 4-Pos JST cable has female connectors at both ends for conveying data between electronics in your project. It is the same cable included with the goBILDA® Odometry Pod. FTC Teams: this cable can connect the goBILDA® Odometry Pod to the REV Control Hub.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/jst-ph-cable-4-pos-jst-ph-mh-fc-to-mh-fc-600mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2011/images/11027/Ang1__77079__67636.1701994290.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST PH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Extension (MH-FC to MH-FC, 100mm Length)', '3804-1717-0100', 'This 100mm length servo extension has TJC8 (MH-FC) connectors on each end. MH-FC means the plastic housing is male and the contacts within are female. This is the same connector as found on most servos. This extension is great for connecting to 2.54mm (0.100") pitch header row pins.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-extension-mh-fc-to-mh-fc-100mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/889/images/4776/3804-1717-0100__53789__92684.1701992299.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Extension (MH-FC to MH-FC, 150mm Length)', '3804-1717-0150', 'This 150mm length servo extension has TJC8 (MH-FC) connectors on each end. MH-FC means the plastic housing is male and the contacts within are female. This is the same connector as found on most servos. This extension is great for connecting to 2.54mm (0.100") pitch header row pins.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-extension-mh-fc-to-mh-fc-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/883/images/4770/3804-1717-0150__40794__82094.1701992295.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Extension (MH-FC to MH-FC, 300mm Length)', '3804-1717-0300', 'This 300mm length servo extension has TJC8 (MH-FC) connectors on each end. MH-FC means the plastic housing is male and the contacts within are female. This is the same connector as found on most servos. This extension is great for connecting to 2.54mm (0.100") pitch header row pins.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-extension-mh-fc-to-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/885/images/4772/3804-1717-0300__31831__37425.1701992296.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('Female to Female Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 10cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3804-1919-0010', 'This 40 pack of 10cm length jumpers is great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each end of the jumper is terminated with TJC8 (MH-FC) connectors which are able to connect with 2.54cm (0.1") spacing row pins or a TJC8 (FH-MC) connector.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/female-to-female-jumper-wire-multicolor-10cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1198/images/5997/3804-1919-0010__68495__05822.1701992715.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Female to Female Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 20cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3804-1919-0020', 'This 40 pack of 20cm length jumpers is great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each end of the jumper is terminated with TJC8 (MH-FC) connectors which are able to connect with 2.54cm (0.1") spacing row pins or a TJC8 (FH-MC) connector.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/female-to-female-jumper-wire-multicolor-20cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1201/images/6002/3804-1919-0020__21434__89116.1701992717.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Female to Female Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 50cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3804-1919-0050', 'This 40 pack of 50cm length jumpers is great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each end of the jumper is terminated with TJC8 (MH-FC) connectors which are able to connect with 2.54cm (0.1") spacing row pins or a TJC8 (FH-MC) connector.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/female-to-female-jumper-wire-multicolor-50cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1203/images/6009/3804-1919-0050__37031__28075.1701992720.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Male to Male Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 10cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3804-2020-0010', 'This 40 pack of 10cm length jumpers are great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each end of the jumper is terminated with TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors which are able to connect to a breadboard or TJC8 (MH-FC) connector.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/male-to-male-jumper-wire-multicolor-10cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1206/images/6026/3804-2020-0010_New__15133__31550.1701992725.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Male to Male Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 20cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3804-2020-0020', 'This 40 pack of 20cm length jumpers are great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each end of the jumper is terminated with TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors which are able to connect to a breadboard or TJC8 (MH-FC) connector.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/male-to-male-jumper-wire-multicolor-20cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1208/images/6035/3804-2020-0020_New__28665__11040.1701992727.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('Male to Male Jumper Wire (Multicolor, 50cm Length) - 40 Pack', '3804-2020-0050', 'This 40 pack of 50cm length jumpers is great for wiring on breadboards and microcontrollers. Each end of the jumper is terminated with TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors which are able to connect to a breadboard or TJC8 (MH-FC) connector.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/male-to-male-jumper-wire-multicolor-50cm-length-40-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1210/images/6044/3804-2020-0050_new__84030__19609.1701992729.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Jumper Wires', 'gobilda'),
  ('JST PH Cable (3-Pos JST PH, MH-FC to MH-FC, 300mm Length)', '3804-5454-0300', 'Let there be lights…that are linked to one(25) another! When your build needs a legion of lumens, a JST extension (like this 300mm length extension) provides just the connection you need. Many of our LED light solutions have JST ports. You can use those ports with this extension to connect one(26) light to the next and ensure that all connected lights operate in unison! JST PH is a common connector style. The three-position configuration of this cable allows it to perform as a single-cable solution…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/jst-ph-cable-3-pos-jst-ph-mh-fc-to-mh-fc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2371/images/14862/3804-5454-0300-ang1__68638.1747681334.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: JST PH Series', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Y-Harness (Single FH-MC XT30 to Dual MH-FC XT30, 150mm Length)', '3805-0102-0150', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-y-harness-single-fh-mc-xt30-to-dual-mh-fc-xt30-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1561/images/8167/3805-0102-0150__17309__39777.1701993379.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('3.5mm Bullet Y-Harness (Single FH-MC to Dual MH-FC, 150mm Length)', '3805-1213-0150', 'This 150mm length Y-harness is handy to have when wiring motors in parallel. There is a pair of red MH-FC (Male Housing - Female Contact) ends and a pair of black MH-FC ends which allow two motors to be able to be plugged in to a single harness. The red pair is necked down into a single FH-MC (Female Housing - Male Contact) as is the black pair so that the harness can plug into a single channel in a motor controller, switch, power source or adaptor. This will cause the motors to run in unison…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-5mm-bullet-y-harness-single-fh-mc-to-dual-mh-fc-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1215/images/6062/3805-1213-0150__83973__68231.1701992735.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: 3.5mm Bullet', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT60 to XT30 Y-Harness (Single FH-MC XT60 to Dual MH-FC XT30, 150mm Length)', '3805-1602-0150', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt60-to-xt30-y-harness-single-fh-mc-xt60-to-dual-mh-fc-xt30-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1559/images/8158/3805-1602-0150__81979__14616.1701993376.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT60', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Y-Harness (Single MH-FC to Dual FH-MC, 150mm Length)', '3805-1718-0150', 'This 150mm length servo Y-harness has a single TJC8 (MH-FC) connector on one(27) end and a pair of TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors on the opposing end. You can use a Y-harness to run two servos off the same signal, to connect power near a high-current servo to protect the traces of the circuit board, or to connect a component that requires the same PWM signal as a servo on the other leg of the harness.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-y-harness-single-mh-fc-to-dual-fh-mc-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/887/images/4774/3805-1718-0150__83712__65685.1701992297.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Y-Harness (Single MH-FC to Dual FH-MC, 300mm Length)', '3805-1718-0300', 'This 300mm length servo Y-harness has a single TJC8 (MH-FC) connector on one(28) end and a pair of TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors on the opposing end. You can use a Y-harness to run two servos off the same signal, to connect power near a high-current servo to protect the traces of the circuit board, or to connect a component that requires the same PWM signal as a servo on the other leg of the harness.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-y-harness-single-mh-fc-to-dual-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/890/images/4777/3805-1718-0300__24922__94670.1701992299.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Y-Harness (Single MH-FC to Dual FH-MC, 450mm Length)', '3805-1718-0450', 'This 450mm length servo Y-harness has a single TJC8 (MH-FC) connector on one(29) end and a pair of TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors on the opposing end. You can use a Y-harness to run two servos off the same signal, to connect power near a high-current servo to protect the traces of the circuit board, or to connect a component that requires the same PWM signal as a servo on the other leg of the harness.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-y-harness-single-mh-fc-to-dual-fh-mc-450mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/891/images/4778/3805-1718-0450__76699__03692.1701992300.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-Pos TJC8 Servo Y-Harness (Single MH-FC to Dual FH-MC, 600mm Length)', '3805-1718-0600', 'This 600mm length servo Y-harness has a single TJC8 (MH-FC) connector on one(30) end and a pair of TJC8 (FH-MC) connectors on the opposing end. You can use a Y-harness to run two servos off the same signal, to connect power near a high-current servo to protect the traces of the circuit board, or to connect a component that requires the same PWM signal as a servo on the other leg of the harness.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-pos-tjc8-servo-y-harness-single-mh-fc-to-dual-fh-mc-600mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/893/images/4780/3805-1718-0600__53313__12875.1701992302.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: TJC8 Servo', 'gobilda'),
  ('(1) XT90 to (3) XT30 Harness (Single FH-MC XT90 to Triple MH-FC XT30, 150mm Length)', '3805-4002-0150', 'This 150mm Length XT90 to XT30 Y-Harness triples your XT90-to-XT30 possibilities by offering a way to split out the power from an XT90 input (such as the goBILDA® Smart Dock) across three different XT30 outputs to feed juice to your electronics and motion components. It''s a fantastic solution for a wheeled chassis project that uses two motor controllers. With this Y-Harness in your wiring setup, you can use just one(31) XT90 input to cover those two bad boys and power your chassis'' headlight with…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1-xt90-to-3-xt30-harness-single-fh-mc-xt90-to-triple-mh-fc-xt30-150mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2124/images/11611/3805-4002-0150-Ang1__18948__96319.1712946712.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT30', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT90 Y-Harness (Single FH-MC XT90 to Dual MH-FC XT90, 300mm Length)', '3805-4041-0300', 'This 300mm length wire harness breaks out power from a XT90 input between two XT90 outputs.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt90-y-harness-single-fh-mc-xt90-to-dual-mh-fc-xt90-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2340/images/14309/3805-4041-0300__46407__67131.1736522103.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Connector Style: XT90', 'gobilda'),
  ('3 Conductor, 22AWG, Twisted Wire (15M Length)', '3806-0322-0015', 'This 22AWG bulk wire is a 3 conductor, twisted wire with an ABS jacket and stranded copper conductors. It''s a match to what Hitec uses on many of their high-end servos so if you''d like to minimize the number of connections between your servo and controller, this wire is a great option. There are many other applications for 3 conductor wire, however, such as wiring up limit switches.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-conductor-22awg-twisted-wire-15m-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/895/images/4785/3806-0322-0015__00021__40277.1701992304.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('12AWG Premium Silicone-Jacket Wire (3M Length) — Red', '3807-0112-0300', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12awg-premium-silicone-jacket-wire-3m-length/?sku=3807-0112-0300', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1499/images/7648/3807_12AWG__82625__16503.1701993229.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Wire', 'gobilda'),
  ('16AWG Premium Silicone-Jacket Wire (3M Length) — Red', '3807-0116-0300', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/16awg-premium-silicone-jacket-wire-3m-length/?sku=3807-0116-0300', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1498/images/7639/3807_16AWG__48966__53706.1701993227.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Wire', 'gobilda'),
  ('12AWG Premium Silicone-Jacket Wire (3M Length) — Black', '3807-0212-0300', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12awg-premium-silicone-jacket-wire-3m-length/?sku=3807-0212-0300', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1499/images/7648/3807_12AWG__82625__16503.1701993229.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Wire', 'gobilda'),
  ('16AWG Premium Silicone-Jacket Wire (3M Length) — Black', '3807-0216-0300', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/16awg-premium-silicone-jacket-wire-3m-length/?sku=3807-0216-0300', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1498/images/7639/3807_16AWG__48966__53706.1701993227.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring / Wire', 'gobilda'),
  ('3900 Series Bearing Adaptor for LEGO Axle (6mm OD, 5mm Length) - 12 Pack', '3900-0005-0006', 'This bearing adaptor allows you to adapt a 6mm ID bearing to accept a LEGO® Axle. The relief cuts allows the adaptor to snap into a bearing which has a 5mm overall thickness and the flanged ends keep the adaptor from sliding out.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3900-series-bearing-adaptor-for-lego-axle-6mm-od-5mm-length-12-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/598/images/3669/3900-0005-0006__75674__36852.1701991968.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1.19 Turn Max Rotation (Stock)', '3938200', 'The HSR-M9382TH is the new king of standard size servos! We''ve waited a long time for a multi-turn servo of this stature and are positively giddy about what Hitec has delivered. Check out some of its high points: Multi-Turn: Let''s start with the killer feature! It''s multi-turn while retaining position feedback. How many turns, you ask? Up to 7 turns! But as with any servo, its rotation depends on the signal you send to it. Programmable: You can plug the servo in and run it with your servo…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hsr-m9382th-servo/?sku=3938200', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1734/images/9112/HSB-M9382TH__90215__45189.1701993684.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Standard Size Servos', 'gobilda'),
  ('1.75 Turn Max Rotation', '3938203', 'The HSR-M9382TH is the new king of standard size servos! We''ve waited a long time for a multi-turn servo of this stature and are positively giddy about what Hitec has delivered. Check out some of its high points: Multi-Turn: Let''s start with the killer feature! It''s multi-turn while retaining position feedback. How many turns, you ask? Up to 7 turns! But as with any servo, its rotation depends on the signal you send to it. Programmable: You can plug the servo in and run it with your servo…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hsr-m9382th-servo/?sku=3938203', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1734/images/9112/HSB-M9382TH__90215__45189.1701993684.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Standard Size Servos', 'gobilda'),
  ('7 Turn Max Rotation', '3938204', 'The HSR-M9382TH is the new king of standard size servos! We''ve waited a long time for a multi-turn servo of this stature and are positively giddy about what Hitec has delivered. Check out some of its high points: Multi-Turn: Let''s start with the killer feature! It''s multi-turn while retaining position feedback. How many turns, you ask? Up to 7 turns! But as with any servo, its rotation depends on the signal you send to it. Programmable: You can plug the servo in and run it with your servo…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hsr-m9382th-servo/?sku=3938204', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1734/images/9112/HSB-M9382TH__90215__45189.1701993684.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Standard Size Servos', 'gobilda'),
  ('HSR-M9382TH Servo — Continuous', '3938221', 'The HSR-M9382TH is the new king of standard size servos! We''ve waited a long time for a multi-turn servo of this stature and are positively giddy about what Hitec has delivered. Check out some of its high points: Multi-Turn: Let''s start with the killer feature! It''s multi-turn while retaining position feedback. How many turns, you ask? Up to 7 turns! But as with any servo, its rotation depends on the signal you send to it. Programmable: You can plug the servo in and run it with your servo…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hsr-m9382th-servo/?sku=3938221', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1734/images/9112/HSB-M9382TH__90215__45189.1701993684.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Standard Size Servos', 'gobilda'),
