  ('4002 Series Flexible Clamping Shaft Coupler (6mm Round Bore to 8mm Round Bore)', '4002-0006-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4002-series-flexible-clamping-shaft-coupler-6mm-round-bore-to-8mm-round-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/605/images/3689/4002-0006-0008__13476__74336.1701991976.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 6mm - 8mm Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4002 Series Flexible Clamping Shaft Coupler (6mm Round Bore to 0.250" Round Bore)', '4002-0006-0250', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4002-series-flexible-clamping-shaft-coupler-6mm-round-bore-to-0-250-round-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/607/images/3698/4002-0006-0250__41479__75288.1701991978.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 6mm - 1/4" Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4002 Series Flexible Clamping Shaft Coupler (8mm Round Bore to 0.250" Round Bore)', '4002-0008-0250', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4002-series-flexible-clamping-shaft-coupler-8mm-round-bore-to-0-250-round-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/609/images/3706/4002-0008-0250__27592__77007.1701991981.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 8mm - 1/4" Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4003 Series Set-Screw Universal Joint (6mm D-Bore to 6mm D-Bore)', '4003-1006-1006', 'This universal joint is specific to transferring rotational motion from one(32) 6mm d-shaft to another. The D-profile, combined with a set screw in each side, ensures the shafts won''t slip and the torque can be reliably transferred down the drivetrain of your robot.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4003-series-set-screw-universal-joint-6mm-d-bore-to-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/611/images/3712/4003-1006-1006__33613__58786.1701991983.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('4004 Series Heavy Duty Clamping Shaft Coupler (6mm D-Bore to 6mm D-Bore)', '4004-1006-1006', 'This product has been discontinued. It has been replaced by the 4007-1006-1006. This coupler is a robust solution for joining two 6mm D-shafts. The two pinch bolts per half puts an extreme hold on each shaft to transfer torque without the chance of slipping. The OD of the coupler allows a tool to pass by and access screws on the 16mm hub pattern. The length of the coupler allows it to easily fit inside the 1120 Series U-Channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4004-series-heavy-duty-clamping-shaft-coupler-6mm-d-bore-to-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1058/images/5148/4004-1006-1006__96199__87906.1701992445.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('4005 Series Pattern Mount Universal Joint (16-1)', '4005-0016-0001', 'The Pattern Mount Universal Joint is the big brother to the 4003-1006-1006 Set Screw Universal Joint. As its name suggests, this joint is able to fasten to the 16mm goBILDA pattern to create large, robust rotating assemblies. Each of its M4 bolt passes through a 4mm ID ball bearing to maintain a low coefficient of friction.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4005-series-pattern-mount-universal-joint-16-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1158/images/5797/4005-0016-0001-Rev1-Main__11169__84009.1701992649.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / CV & Universal Joints', 'gobilda'),
  ('4006 Series Hyper Coupler (8mm Round Bore to 6mm D-Bore)', '4006-0008-1006', 'This Hyper Coupler has an 8mm round bore on one(33) end and a 6mm D-bore on the other. While it has many uses, one(34) common one(35) is to join the 6mm D-shaft of a motor to an 8mm lead screw. Given the length of the coupler, there''s a considerable amount of surface contact between the outer profile of the 8mm lead screw and the internal bore of the coupler to create a solid connection.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4006-series-hyper-coupler-8mm-round-bore-to-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1133/images/11935/4006-0008-1006-Round-Bore__36258.1715803912.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 6mm - 8mm Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4006 Series Hyper Coupler (6mm D-Bore to 5mm Hex Bore)', '4006-1006-2005', 'For those using REV Robotics parts within FTC, this coupler will allow you to adapt from a 6mm D-shaft to REV 5mm HEX and vise-versa.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4006-series-hyper-coupler-6mm-d-bore-to-5mm-hex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1135/images/11937/4006-1006-2005__97340.1715803941.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (6mm Round Bore to 6mm Round Bore)', '4007-0006-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-6mm-round-bore-to-6mm-round-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1605/images/11940/4007-0006-0006-Patented__47719.1715804049.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 6mm - 6mm Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (8mm Round Bore to 8mm REX® Bore)', '4007-0008-4008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-8mm-round-bore-to-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1579/images/11942/4007-0008-4008__07646.1721397132.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 8mm - 8mm REX™ Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (6mm D-Bore to 6mm D-Bore)', '4007-1006-1006', 'This 6mm D-Bore to 6mm D-Bore Hyper Coupler is a strong, compact, balanced way to couple two shafts together. As with all ''Hyper'' parts, this too is balanced so you can spin it up without concern of creating unwanted vibrations through your drivetrain.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-6mm-d-bore-to-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1457/images/11953/4007-1006-1006__75125.1715885079.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 6mm - 6mm Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (6mm D-Bore to 5mm Hex Bore)', '4007-1006-2005', 'For those using REV Robotics parts within FTC, this coupler will allow you to adapt from a 6mm D-shaft to REV 5mm HEX and vice-versa.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-6mm-d-bore-to-5mm-hex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2479/images/16507/Ang1__44032.1776458813.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / 6mm Bore Couplers', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (6mm D-Bore to 8mm REX Bore®)', '4007-1006-4008', 'This 6mm D-Bore to 8mm REX® bore Hyper Coupler is a strong, compact, balanced way to couple two shafts together. Maybe you have motors with 6mm d-shafting but you want to step up your game and run 8mm REX® to handle higher torque loads. Maybe you''re going the other way due to a surplus of 6mm D-bore pinion gears, hubs, sprockets, etc. The diameter of the coupler has been thoughtfully chosen so that, when installed, you can still access screws on the 16mm pattern with the use of a hex key. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-6mm-d-bore-to-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1226/images/11949/4007-1006-4008-RHEX-Bore__82759.1715877391.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 6mm D - 8mm REX™ Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (5mm Hex Bore to 8mm REX® Bore)', '4007-2005-4008', 'Do you have both REV and goBILDA® in your war chest of FTC parts? This adaptor coupler allows you to elegantly merge the two build systems when the creative process calls! As is standard with all goBILDA® Hyper Couplers, it''s balanced, and clasps with a stupendous gorilla grip: each end of the coupler rocks a pair of M4 pinch bolts that constrict the coupler for a solid, non-marring hold you can rely on! Running this coupler near a bearing? Built-in shims on each end to help to keep your…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-5mm-hex-bore-to-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2426/images/15249/Ang1__84617__07913.1758747003.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Hyper Couplers', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (1/2" Hex Bore to 8mm REX® Bore)', '4007-2500-4008', 'Do you have both VEX® and goBILDA® in your war chest of FTC parts? This adaptor coupler allows you to elegantly merge the two build systems when the creative process calls! As is standard with all goBILDA® Hyper Couplers, it''s balanced, and clasps like a firm gorilla handshake: each end of the coupler rocks a pair of M4 pinch bolts that constrict the coupler for a solid, non-marring hold you can rely on! Running this coupler near a bearing? Built-in shims on each end to help to keep your…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-1-2-hex-bore-to-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2425/images/15244/Ang1__70213__71552.1758817321.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Hyper Couplers', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (8mm REX® Bore to 8mm REX® Bore)', '4007-4008-4008', 'This 8mm REX® bore Coupler allows you to connect 8mm REX® shafts together in a compact and balanced form-factor. And as with all ''Hyper'' parts, this too is balanced so you can spin it up without concern of creating unwanted vibrations through your drivetrain.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-8mm-rex-bore-to-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1313/images/11947/4007-4008-4008__11633.1715877362.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 8mm REX™ - 8mm REX™ Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (8mm REX® Bore to 12mm REX® Bore)', '4007-4008-4012', 'This 8mm REX® to 12mm REX® coupler is a compact, balanced way to fasten an 8mm REX® shaft to a 12mm REX® shaft. The 21mm overall length allows you to slide the coupler down inside of 1120 Series Channel even when one(36) of the two shafts is inserted half-way through the inside cavity. The bores of the coupler are profile-matched to create a positive drive. That, in combination with four pinch bolts, provides an extremely solid connection that is able to hold loads in both the radial and axial…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-8mm-rex-bore-to-12mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1273/images/11944/4007-4008-4007-8mm-Side__40242.1715876535.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Shop by Coupler Bore / Couplers: 8mm REX™ - 12mm REX™ Bore', 'gobilda'),
  ('4007 Series Hyper Coupler (12mm REX® Bore to 12mm REX® Bore)', '4007-4012-4012', 'Designed for heavy-duty action with positive-drive shafting, this 12mm REX® Bore Coupler allows you to connect two lengths of 12mm REX® shafting together in a compact form factor. And as with all components of the "Hyper" moniker, this Coupler is exquisitely balanced—you can spin it up without concern of creating unwanted vibrations through your drivetrain. The convenient built-in shims allow you to put the coupler against a bearing without contacting the bearing''s outer race.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4007-series-hyper-coupler-12mm-rex-bore-to-12mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2383/images/14702/4007-4012-4012__78316__74569.1744657186.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Couplers / Hyper Couplers', 'gobilda'),
