  ('4100 Series Aluminum Tube (27mm ID x 32mm OD, 50mm Length)', '4100-2732-0050', '27mm ID x 32mm OD Aluminum Tubing is the largest diameter tubing we offer, and with the thickest wall for unmatched strength. The 27mm bore can be used to run wires through to keep a clean look while protecting the vitals of your robot. This bore size can also be used to run smaller diameters of shafting and tubing through so that you can make complex rotating assemblies that are concentric, but independent of one(37) another.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4100-series-aluminum-tube-27mm-id-x-32mm-od-50mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/633/images/3768/4100-2732-0050__06906__88694.1701992003.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Aluminum Tubing', 'gobilda'),
