  ('4100 Series Aluminum Tube (27mm ID x 32mm OD, 300mm Length)', '4100-2732-0300', '27mm ID x 32mm OD Aluminum Tubing is the largest diameter tubing we offer, and with the thickest wall for unmatched strength. The 27mm bore can be used to run wires through to keep a clean look while protecting the vitals of your robot. This bore size can also be used to run smaller diameters of shafting and tubing through so that you can make complex rotating assemblies that are concentric, but independent of one(41) another.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4100-series-aluminum-tube-27mm-id-x-32mm-od-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/641/images/3810/4100-2732-0300__87213__43893.1701992015.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Aluminum Tubing', 'gobilda'),
  ('4100 Series Aluminum Tube (27mm ID x 32mm OD, 600mm Length)', '4100-2732-0600', '27mm ID x 32mm OD Aluminum Tubing is the largest diameter tubing we offer, and with the thickest wall for unmatched strength. The 27mm bore can be used to run wires through to keep a clean look while protecting the vitals of your robot. This bore size can also be used to run smaller diameters of shafting and tubing through so that you can make complex rotating assemblies that are concentric, but independent of one(42) another.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4100-series-aluminum-tube-27mm-id-x-32mm-od-600mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/632/images/3763/4100-2732-0600__28681__69277.1701992001.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Aluminum Tubing', 'gobilda'),
  ('4101 Series Aluminum Tube for Lead Screw Square Nut (10mm ID x 14mm OD, 300mm Length)', '4101-1014-0300', 'This aluminum tube is able to thread onto the Lead Screw Square Nut and serve as an extension rod of a linear actuator. one(43) of the two internal M12 x 1.25mm threaded ends can fasten to the Lead Screw Square Nut while the other is available for possible future offerings to thread into. The tube is able to slide inside of the 14mm bore of goRAIL® and goTUBE which can act as the linear actuator housing. As the Lead Screw Square Nut that the tube is mounted to is driven by an 8mm Lead Screw, the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4101-series-aluminum-tube-for-lead-screw-square-nut-10mm-id-x-14mm-od-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/634/images/3770/4101-1014-0300__80468__90001.1701992003.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Aluminum Tubing for Lead Screw Square Nut', 'gobilda'),
  ('4102 Series Aluminum Flanged Tube (27mm ID x 32mm OD, 55mm Length)', '4102-2732-0055', 'This flanged aluminum tube is the peanut butter to a 32mm bore pillow block''s jelly! 1602 Series pillow blocks are great for builds on the outside of channel, while the 1604 Series are fantastic for builds within channel. Both series offer 32mm bore pillow blocks that can jive with this tube to create a special recipe for an on-pattern motion assembly: when you seat this tube within two such pillow blocks that are mounted on the goBILDA® 8mm pattern grid, the length value of the tube that…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4102-series-aluminum-flanged-tube-27mm-id-x-32mm-od-55mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2370/images/14551/4102-2732-0055_Ang1__00318__16604.1741296316.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Flanged Aluminum Tubing', 'gobilda'),
  ('4102 Series Aluminum Flanged Tube (28mm ID x 32mm OD, 39mm Length)', '4102-2832-0039', 'This flanged aluminum tube is the appropriate length for use with 32mm pillow blocks spaced 16mm apart. The remaining length is perfect for adding a 6mm length 32mm ID spacer, and a 32mm bore clamping hub.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4102-series-aluminum-flanged-tube-28mm-id-x-32mm-od-39mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/636/images/3780/4102-2832-0039__02862__32469.1701992006.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('4103 Series goTUBE (43mm Length)', '4103-0032-0043', 'The 43mm length goTUBE is an excellent option for adding structural integrity to 1120 Series U-Channel with minimal weight gain. It spans across the 43mm inside width of the 1120 Series U-Channel and aligns with any 14mm hole in the channel so that you can run bearings and shafting through.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4103-series-gotube-43mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/638/images/3793/4103-0032-0043Ang1PatentPending__81790__36135.1701992010.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / 4103 Series goTUBE', 'gobilda'),
