  ('4103 Series goTUBE (528mm Length)', '4103-0032-0528', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4103-series-gotube-528mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/653/images/3888/4103-0032-0528Ang1PatentPending__41328__10775.1701992037.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / 4103 Series goTUBE', 'gobilda'),
  ('4103 Series goTUBE (624mm Length)', '4103-0032-0624', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4103-series-gotube-624mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/654/images/3897/4103-0032-0624Ang1PatentPending__99836__08212.1701992040.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / 4103 Series goTUBE', 'gobilda'),
  ('4103 Series goTUBE (912mm Length)', '4103-0032-0912', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4103-series-gotube-912mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/656/images/3906/4103-0032-1200Ang1PatentPending__49462__37268.1701992043.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / 4103 Series goTUBE', 'gobilda'),
  ('4103 Series goTUBE (1200mm Length)', '4103-0032-1200', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4103-series-gotube-1200mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/658/images/3915/4103-0032-1200Ang1PatentPending__14890__53817.1701992045.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / 4103 Series goTUBE', 'gobilda'),
  ('2.5mm Hex L-Key', '4200-0090-0025', 'The 2.5mm hex size is found on M4 low-head screws, M4 button head screws and M5 set-screws.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2-5mm-hex-l-key/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/660/images/3918/4200-0090-0025__77706__62829.1701992046.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3mm Hex L-Key', '4200-0090-0030', 'The 3mm hex size is found on M4 socket head screws.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3mm-hex-l-key/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/652/images/3889/4200-0090-0030__35458__90904.1701992037.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('7mm Combination Wrench', '4202-0070-1070', 'This 7mm combination wrench works with any of the M4 nuts. The open end allows you to get into hard to reach places, and to keep a nut from spinning. The box end is available for a sure hold when you need to tighten a nut down very tightly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/7mm-combination-wrench/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/659/images/3916/4202-0070-1070__16815__34148.1701992045.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Chain Tool', '4203-0001-0008', 'This tool makes customizing the length of 8mm (05B) chain a breeze! The tool serves as a chain breaker and a chain assembly tool as it is able to precisely push the pins out and back in. Unlike other chain tools, the design properly supports the chain links so that the pressure created by removing and/or installing the pin doesn''t cause the links to bind.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-chain-tool/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1224/images/6100/4203-0001-0008__63775__22560.1701992749.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('Replacement Breaker Screw for 8mm Pitch Chain Tool', '4203-0101-0008', 'This replacement breaker screw is to be used in the 8mm Pitch Chain Tool. While the breaker screw that''s included with the chain tool should provide years of reliable service, a replacement screw can provide peace of mind when you''re doing those last minute mods to your robot chassis.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/replacement-breaker-screw-for-8mm-pitch-chain-tool/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1257/images/6238/4203-0101-0008__89089__79093.1701992791.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('M4 x 0.7mm Thread Starting Tap', '4204-0001-0004', 'This M4 x 0.7mm thread starting tap can be used for cutting new threads or to clean up damaged threads in a previously tapped hole. This tap has several tapered threads at the end to guide the tap into the hole and begin cutting threads. Recommended for steel, iron, stainless steel, nickel, aluminum, brass, bronze, copper and plastic. Be sure to use lubricant and occasionally back the tap out to clear out shavings during usage.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/m4-x-0-7mm-thread-starting-tap/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1188/images/5946/4204-0001-0004_02__93079__32825.1701992699.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Sliding T-Handle Tap Wrench', '4204-0002-0001', 'A T-handle tap wrench is a handy tool to have in your toolbox if you plan to modify parts. With a tap wrench and an M4 tap you can easily add threads to the end of goTUBE and goRAIL® that''s been cut to a custom length. The tap wrench accepts a tap with a 0.110" to 0.191" square shank which is commonly found on Metric taps ranging in size from M1.6 up to M6.3 and imperial taps from #0 up to ¼". The sliding handle makes it possible to thread holes in locations with limited clearance.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/sliding-t-handle-tap-wrench/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1182/images/5915/4204-0002-0001__03002__52215.1701992689.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('3-in-1 Snap Ring Pliers', '4205-0001-0001', 'The 3-in-1 Snap Ring Pliers have swappable heads to provide different angles of approach when removing and installing snap rings. Additionally, you can choose to install the heads on two different sets of pins. one(44) set will make the jaws open when the plier handles are squeezed, most commonly used for external snap rings. The other set of pins will make the jaws close when the plier handles are squeezed, most commonly used for internal snap rings. The included heads consist of two straight…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-in-1-snap-ring-pliers/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1262/images/6255/4205-0001-0001__18124__56505.1701992798.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('7mm Combination Nut Driver', '4206-0070-0001', 'This nut driver is super handy to have when building with M4 hardware. It has a long end and a short end; both 7mm hex. The long end has a deep counterbore beyond the hex drive so that you can drive a nut even if the threads of the bolt (or threaded rod) protrude beyond the top edge of the nut. To gain leverage you can use the short end of the driver. It has a thru-hole beyond the hex drive so you have no limitation on how far past the nut the threads protrude. Because this end of the driver…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/7mm-combination-nut-driver/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1285/images/6361/4206-0070-0001__65563__80580.1701992827.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('3.3mm Cobalt Steel Drill Bit', '4207-0001-0033', 'This 3.3mm bit creates the appropriate hole size to accept our M4 tap. A 3.3mm hole will yield 75% thread insertion which is recommended for aluminum, brass, plastic and other soft materials.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3-3mm-cobalt-steel-drill-bit/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1287/images/6365/4207-0001-0033_Ang2__76006__24674.1701992828.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('4.0mm Cobalt Steel Drill Bit', '4207-0001-0040', 'This 4.0mm drill bit will allow you to create thru-holes for M4 hardware.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-0mm-cobalt-steel-drill-bit/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1288/images/6368/4207-0001-0040__06367__02585.1701992829.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hitec RDX2 200 AC/DC Multi-Function Smart Charger', '44370', 'Capable of charging two batteries simultaneously, regardless of chemistry or capacity, the RDX2 200 allows you to connect different battery chemistries (NiMH/NiCd/LiPo/LiFe/Lilo/LiHV/Pb) into any of the two charging ports (100W per port, 200W total power) and features integrated balancing for 6-cell LiPo batteries. Designed with an easy-to-read LCD screen and sleek metal scroll wheel for simple setting selection, this twin-channel charger is also compatible with Hitec''s "Charge Master" PC…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hitec-rdx2-200-ac-dc-multi-function-smart-charger/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2276/images/13487/RDX2-200_Ang-2__46627__76499__64767.1728570864.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Chargers', 'gobilda'),
  ('DPC-11 Universal Programming Interface for Hitec''s Programmable Servos', '44429', 'The Hitec DPC-11 Servo Programmer is an extremely capable programmer in an affordable form-factor. With this programmer, you can tailor the many adjustable aspects of a compatible Hitec digital servo. It''s computer interface so you''ll need a PC with the free downloadable software, a Mini USB to USB cable and a 4.8-6V battery to power the programmer. Features: Customize the Parameters of Hitec''s Programmable DXXX, HSB-9XXX, HS-7XXX and HS-5XXX Series Servo Test Settings Prior to Servo…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dpc-11-universal-programming-interface-for-hitecs-programmable-servos/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/897/images/4793/44429__16652__56182.1701992306.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('5000 Series 12VDC Motor', '5000-0002-0001', 'This brushed DC motor is legal in FTC (FIRST Tech Challenge). It''s the powerhouse driving the gearboxes of our Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motors, and can swap into those motors to perform as a replacement core, if ever required. Its encoder is designed to work at 3.3V or 5V. Whether you are using an Arduino or the REV Expansion Hub, you don''t need to bother with a logic level converter.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5000-series-12vdc-motor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1265/images/6267/5000-0002-0001_Rev2__75219__73491.1752165774.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / 5000 Series Motors', 'gobilda'),
  ('Modern Robotics/MATRIX 12VDC Motor with 17 Tooth Gear', '5000-0002-0117', 'This brushed DC motor from Modern Robotics® is legal in FTC (FIRST Tech Challenge). It is the powerhouse driving the spur and planetary gearboxes of our 5202 Series gear motors. Its encoder is designed to work at 3.3V or 5V. Whether you are using an Arduino or the REV Expansion Hub, you don''t need to bother with a logic level converter. The 17 tooth, MOD 0.5 gear has been pre-installed onto the 1/8" motor shaft so that you can more easily install a gearbox which calls for this size of pinion…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/modern-robotics-matrix-12vdc-motor-with-17-tooth-gear/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1424/images/7052/5000-0002-0117_FTC-Legal__08504__01887.1701993048.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5000 Series 12VDC Motor with 8mm REX® Pinion Shaft', '5000-0002-4008', 'This is the motor that drives the popular Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motors, but with a R ound h EX twist! Where you would normally find a pinion gear, we''ve installed an 8mm REX® pinion shaft. 8mm REX® is the signature positive-drive profile that''s compatible with a wide range of goBILDA® components—from hubs, to gears, to sprockets, pulleys, and more—across our build system ecosystem. And what''s a "pinion shaft?" Well, we didn''t want to cause confusion between the factory motor shaft,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5000-series-12vdc-motor-with-8mm-rex-pinion-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1439/images/7134/5000-0002-4008-REV3-Sticker-Update__78973__34918.1762204310.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / 5000 Series Motors', 'gobilda')
on conflict (btrim(manufacturer), btrim(sku))
  where team_id is null
    and is_official
    and sku is not null
do nothing;

